:"romgerman","id":1517367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTczNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1517367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman","html_url":"https://github.com/romgerman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-13T15:35:52Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T15:35:52Z","body":"This is still reproducible in v4.8.dev.custom_build [63b7e0272].\n\n```\n ERROR: Resource file not found: res://::GDScript_j3pel (expected type: Script)\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5282550955/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5303725207","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118407#issuecomment-5303725207","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118407","id":5303725207,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPCBslw","user":{"login":"lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma","html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-15T18:52:09Z","updated_at":"2026-08-15T18:52:09Z","body":"we use built-in resources as part of the Skeleton3D node, from within the Advanced Import dialog, so the issue is not with built in resources, and blocking those in general would be a problem.\n\nI'm curious if this bug is happening because there would be no way to open such a script in the script editor from the import dock or advanced import dialog. GDScript is one of the resource types that you cannot edit directly in the inspector\n\nBecause built-in resources have other uses, rather than forbidding a built-in resource in general, we should probably solve or disallow specifically creating a new GDSscript.\n\n(another idea could be to allow writing code in the inspector in this case, but that opens up a lot of UX questions)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5303725207/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5375689938","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118407#issuecomment-5375689938","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118407","id":5375689938,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQGqE0g","user":{"login":"Kazuo256","id":645222,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NTIyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/645222?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256","html_url":"https://github.com/Kazuo256","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-21T21:39:09Z","updated_at":"2026-08-21T21:39:09Z","body":"I'm looking this issue up together with a colleague. I've come across [a line in `EditorResourcePicker::_edit_menu_cbk()`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/editor/inspector/editor_resource_picker.cpp#L637) where the resource path is defined and verified that the owner path (the part before the `::` in the resource path) is empty for the root script in imported scenes.\n\nIs there a case where a resource path with an empty \"owner path\" is still a valid path? Maybe this is something we could use?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5375689938/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5416103041","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118407#issuecomment-5416103041","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118407","id":5416103041,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQtMsgQ","user":{"login":"Kazuo256","id":645222,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NTIyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/645222?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256","html_url":"https://github.com/Kazuo256","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazuo256/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-25T20:09:03Z","updated_at":"2026-08-25T20:09:03Z","body":"Another approach we tought of follows Iyuma's idea of disallowing the creation of new GDScript from the `root_script` field. We could change `EditorResourcePicker` to specifically avoid listing `GDScript` as a new resource option (for instance, [by adding an if around this line](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/b56a91878e7c94977e4af978968e41d0670c0a8b/editor/inspector/editor_resource_picker.cpp#L863)). Since the node inspector uses `EditorScriptPicker` instead, changing the general-purpose resource picker should not mess with the script creation workflow in the more common places. At the same time, if other docks use the general-purpose picker, they probably shouldn't allow creating new GDScripts either [since the \"new script\" dialog requires a reference to a node](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/b56a91878e7c94977e4af978968e41d0670c0a8b/editor/inspector/editor_resource_picker.cpp#L1581).\n\nDoes this sound like a good solution to this issue?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5416103041/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5422442301","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118407#issuecomment-5422442301","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118407","id":5422442301,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQzPnPQ","user":{"login":"romgerman","id":1517367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTczNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1517367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman","html_url":"https://github.com/romgerman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-26T08:08:43Z","updated_at":"2026-08-26T08:08:57Z","body":"This error also gets printed when creating a script inside an exported variable with type `GDScript`.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e3c5b902-4059-4204-8489-bfebb833871e","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5422442301/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]